{
  "steps": [
    {
      "npc": "Hello, young adventurer. What brings you to the Museum's paleontology floor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "What's paleontology?",
          "steps": [
            {
              "player": "What's paleontology?"
            },
            {
              "npc": "I'm glad you asked! Paleontology is the study of prehistoric lifeforms in Gielinor through the examination of fossils."
            },
            {
              "npc": "We use fossils to try determine several things: information about what fossil belonged to, what the environment was like, and try to uncover secrets of Gielinor's past."
            },
            {
              "npc": "What else would you like to know?"
            },
            {
              "type": "jump",
              "reference": "previous",
              "id": "oSYDpF"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Where do these fossils come from?",
          "steps": [
            {
              "player": "Where do these fossils come from?"
            },
            {
              "npc": "Ah, brilliant question. Fossils of creatures are found in sedimentary rock, we use specialised tools to carefully remove the unwanted rock only leaving only the fossil behind."
            },
            {
              "npc": "If you're looking for fossils yourself, I hear there is a voyage to a mysterious island to discover new types of fossil."
            },
            {
              "npc": "You should speak to the Curator as he knows more about it than I."
            },
            {
              "npc": "Is there anything else you need help with?"
            },
            {
              "type": "jump",
              "reference": "previous",
              "id": "TbTDi7"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "What can I do with these fossils?",
          "steps": [
            {
              "player": "What can I do with these fossils?"
            },
            {
              "npc": "Any fossils you find can be added to the surrounding display cases."
            },
            {
              "npc": "If you manage to complete display case, the Museum will ensure you are rewarded for your efforts."
            },
            {
              "npc": "Also, if you find any rare fossils on your travels, make sure you hold onto them. Something tells me they will be very valuable in the future..."
            },
            {
              "npc": "Do you have any other questions?"
            },
            {
              "type": "jump",
              "reference": "previous",
              "id": "l31LJ8"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
